<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 26px; text-align: left; color: #000000; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left"><strong>Olentangy Trail Update — Responding to Your Floodplain and Construction Impacts Comments</strong></h1>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Feedback from residents like you is important to the department's work to complete the <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/recreationandparks/trails/olentangy-trail/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Olentangy Trail</a> between <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/recreationandparks/parks/Clinton-Como-Park/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Clinton-Como Park</a> and <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/recreationandparks/parks/Northmoor-Park/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Northmoor Park</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Read all of the comments and responses about the <a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2023/01/25/file_attachments/2390658/Olentangy%20Trail%20Section%204f%20Comment%20Responses.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Section 4(f) construction impacts</a> and <a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2023/01/25/file_attachments/2390659/Olentangy%20Trail%20Floodplain%20Comment%20Responses.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">floodplain impacts</a>. These have also been added to the project website.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">There were also comments submitted about the overall project, which were not directly related to the floodplain and construction impacts. <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/recreationandparks/trails/Public-Comments-with-Grouped-Responses/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Read the grouped responses to overall project comments</a>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you for your interest in the Olentangy Trail project! You can continue to check the <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/recreationandparks/trails/Olentangy-Trail/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">project website</a> for additional updates and information.</p>
</td>
